1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,625
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,627 --> 00:00:03,043
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:05,625
(Episode 65)

4
00:00:07,224 --> 00:00:08,748
The croaker looks good.

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:11,666
You turn someone else's house upside down
and act as if nothing happened.

6
00:00:11,708 --> 00:00:12,958
Forget the croaker.

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Do you really want to see me
retire from this family early?

8
00:00:16,625 --> 00:00:18,291
What a nasty way to talk!

9
00:00:18,958 --> 00:00:22,208
Would it kill you to ask,
"Are you okay, Yeong Ju?"

10
00:00:22,666 --> 00:00:24,583
Who's having a harder time here,
you or me?

11
00:00:24,625 --> 00:00:25,625
Me.

12
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,233
Seriously!

13
00:00:29,625 --> 00:00:34,458
If you were going to live with Na Se Ri,
you should've kept it a secret.

14
00:00:34,538 --> 00:00:36,538
I even deserted, saying I'd kill Na Se Ri.

15
00:00:36,625 --> 00:00:39,333
Now that you're living with her,
how does that make me look?

16
00:00:39,375 --> 00:00:43,625
Whether I forgive her or hate her forever,
what's it to you?

17
00:00:43,666 --> 00:00:46,125
You're really something, aren't you?

18
00:00:46,166 --> 00:00:47,333
Seriously!

19
00:00:50,166 --> 00:00:52,833
You two sure are close for siblings.

20
00:00:53,916 --> 00:00:56,833
You kept quiet about the whole thing
and made fools of us.

21
00:00:57,208 --> 00:01:00,416
I'm sorry, ma'am.

22
00:01:11,708 --> 00:01:14,708
Don't look at me like that.
If you want to curse me out, go ahead.

23
00:01:16,541 --> 00:01:17,541
No.

24
00:01:19,033 --> 00:01:21,333
I think I was wrong
to criticize you all this time.

25
00:01:21,541 --> 00:01:22,916
I should applaud you.

26
00:01:23,166 --> 00:01:28,208
You're amazing, and Ji Ni even donated
her bone marrow.

27
00:01:28,666 --> 00:01:32,041
Softhearted Ji Hu must've been so touched.

28
00:01:32,458 --> 00:01:34,932
- Sun Kyung.
- I've been wondering all this time.

29
00:01:35,583 --> 00:01:39,708
What on earth made Ji Hu risk his life?

30
00:01:40,541 --> 00:01:42,000
Now I understand.

31
00:01:42,041 --> 00:01:43,416
Don't exaggerate.

32
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,291
Ji Hu and Ji Ni met each other
regardless of what happened with O Reum.

33
00:01:47,342 --> 00:01:50,675
And even if it were related,
there's no reason to mock them like this.

34
00:01:50,708 --> 00:01:52,458
Fine, I get it.

35
00:01:53,279 --> 00:01:57,654
How was I supposed to know you'd stoop
so low as to let that mistress...

36
00:01:57,958 --> 00:01:59,708
and her daughter live with your sons?

37
00:02:00,083 --> 00:02:02,958
Someone ordinary like me
could never even imagine doing that.

38
00:02:03,541 --> 00:02:07,458
I'll be sure to brag about you
at our next reunion.

39
00:02:34,542 --> 00:02:35,808
You scared me!

40
00:02:36,333 --> 00:02:37,375
You scared me!

41
00:02:37,458 --> 00:02:39,833
Sa Bin, cut it out!

42
00:02:39,875 --> 00:02:44,000
Don't call me Sa Bin. Call me Uncle.
You called me Uncle after I got married.

43
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:46,791
Think about it, you idiot.

44
00:02:48,125 --> 00:02:51,958
Why couldn't you forget your memories
from England instead of your recent ones?

45
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
I'm going crazy too. Just leave me alone.

46
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:56,708
You poured water on the food and screamed.

47
00:02:56,916 --> 00:03:00,000
My heart's going to give out
before my memory comes back.

48
00:03:00,041 --> 00:03:01,776
I hate acting like this too.

49
00:03:01,863 --> 00:03:04,458
I've always prided myself
on being highly intelligent.

50
00:03:04,791 --> 00:03:07,266
What will it take to jog your memory?

51
00:03:07,525 --> 00:03:08,916
Just try to remember.

52
00:03:10,083 --> 00:03:11,386
Hey, not Do Hee.

53
00:03:11,387 --> 00:03:15,041
Seriously, please, not her.
She's a bad person.

54
00:03:17,666 --> 00:03:19,250
Seriously!

55
00:03:21,791 --> 00:03:22,958
Sa Bin.

56
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,416
Are you really going to England?

57
00:03:25,833 --> 00:03:26,958
I hate it here.

58
00:03:28,041 --> 00:03:31,416
Do you know how frustrating it is
not to understand what you're saying?

59
00:03:32,375 --> 00:03:35,000
You say Do Hee is bad,
but she's nice to me.

60
00:03:35,416 --> 00:03:39,458
You say I liked Ji Ni,
but I don't feel anything for her.

61
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:41,583
That's why I'm telling you
to give it some time.

62
00:03:41,625 --> 00:03:43,666
There's no guarantee I'll ever remember.

63
00:03:44,761 --> 00:03:46,470
I heard it took someone 20 years.

64
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:48,500
What about England?
Will you remember if you go there?

65
00:03:48,541 --> 00:03:52,416
At least there, people know me
as the person I remember being.

66
00:03:53,041 --> 00:03:55,625
Everyone here keeps talking about things
I don't know. It's driving me crazy.

67
00:03:56,458 --> 00:03:59,250
I tried talking to Ji Ni,
but that didn't work either.

68
00:03:59,291 --> 00:04:01,582
She said she couldn't leave
because of her mom.

69
00:04:01,583 --> 00:04:02,896
Exactly.

70
00:04:03,746 --> 00:04:05,375
I guess this is just my fate.

71
00:04:06,625 --> 00:04:08,750
This is driving me insane.

72
00:04:22,583 --> 00:04:25,708
This is the music you always listened to
when you were in a good mood.

73
00:04:37,458 --> 00:04:38,935
Do you remember the music?

74
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:42,829
Do you know
how much you bragged about composing it?

75
00:04:43,666 --> 00:04:45,888
You practically forced me to listen to it.

76
00:04:46,375 --> 00:04:48,125
It's your all-time favorite piece.

77
00:04:50,458 --> 00:04:51,802
My favorite piece?

78
00:04:52,908 --> 00:04:54,293
One I composed?

79
00:05:05,625 --> 00:05:08,066
Yes. We'll turn this setback
into an opportunity.

80
00:05:08,875 --> 00:05:12,916
Ambassador, I'm so grateful
you're doing so much for Ji Hu.

81
00:05:13,083 --> 00:05:16,416
My daughter may be far from perfect,
but she loves Ji Hu. What can I do?

82
00:05:17,166 --> 00:05:20,708
Let's put the past behind us
and work together again.

83
00:05:21,125 --> 00:05:22,287
Yes, of course.

84
00:05:22,793 --> 00:05:25,766
It's late over there. Get some rest. Okay.

85
00:05:27,791 --> 00:05:29,750
- Was that Do Hee's dad?
- Yeah.

86
00:05:29,875 --> 00:05:31,500
That Frieze London you mentioned?

87
00:05:31,531 --> 00:05:33,674
The director is Singaporean.

88
00:05:33,685 --> 00:05:35,250
You probably know him. Marcus Lee.

89
00:05:35,291 --> 00:05:37,502
I've heard of him too.

90
00:05:37,809 --> 00:05:38,916
Think you can handle it?

91
00:05:39,081 --> 00:05:41,079
Of course. I told you he could.

92
00:05:41,318 --> 00:05:43,664
He lost his memory, not his brains.

93
00:05:43,666 --> 00:05:45,625
Right now, I feel pretty stupid.

94
00:05:46,500 --> 00:05:51,750
Everyone talks about things I don't know.
I feel like a monkey in a zoo.

95
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:54,218
Then go.

96
00:05:54,569 --> 00:05:57,375
You said you wanted to get married
and start a family young.

97
00:05:57,916 --> 00:06:01,157
Go start your own family,
build your career,

98
00:06:01,501 --> 00:06:04,083
and come back when you get
your memory back. I'll be waiting.

99
00:06:04,833 --> 00:06:05,916
Thank you, Mom.

100
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,916
I believe in supporting your decisions
once you've made them.

101
00:06:10,483 --> 00:06:13,400
You two are the reason I keep going.

102
00:06:14,458 --> 00:06:15,958
There you go, joking again.

103
00:06:17,125 --> 00:06:19,000
I feel like this is all fate.

104
00:06:27,666 --> 00:06:30,195
He'll feel better once he's back
in England and working again.

105
00:06:30,196 --> 00:06:31,443
Don't worry.

106
00:06:32,496 --> 00:06:34,996
I'm heading to the store.
It's opening day today.

107
00:06:37,125 --> 00:06:38,166
I'm heading out.

108
00:06:55,708 --> 00:06:56,798
Are you going to work?

109
00:06:58,622 --> 00:07:02,081
Can't you change jobs?
Look for something somewhere else.

110
00:07:02,083 --> 00:07:04,500
I'll support you for a while.

111
00:07:06,524 --> 00:07:07,566
Na Ji Ni.

112
00:07:08,541 --> 00:07:09,708
Didn't I tell you not to talk to me?

113
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:13,250
- How long is this going to go on?
- Want me to leave? Cut ties with you?

114
00:07:13,291 --> 00:07:15,708
Fine. Do whatever you want, you brat.

115
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:18,875
You're so stubborn.
You've been driving me crazy for years.

116
00:07:29,255 --> 00:07:30,409
Come eat breakfast.

117
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:37,285
Unless you plan to die of lovesickness,
come out.

118
00:07:37,970 --> 00:07:39,209
Seung Hyun made chicken porridge.

119
00:07:41,333 --> 00:07:44,205
Even if it tastes awful,
eat it and say it's delicious.

120
00:07:44,338 --> 00:07:45,922
What are you doing? Hurry up.

121
00:07:47,083 --> 00:07:48,702
Keep what I just said a secret.

122
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,322
I'll eat later, so go ahead and eat first.

123
00:08:05,333 --> 00:08:06,375
Why?

124
00:08:06,625 --> 00:08:08,610
That girl holds a grudge for ages.

125
00:08:08,669 --> 00:08:10,708
She won't want to eat with me.

126
00:08:11,375 --> 00:08:13,320
I'm ready for that, so don't worry.

127
00:08:14,006 --> 00:08:17,166
Thanks so much for taking care of her.

128
00:08:18,875 --> 00:08:21,210
By the way, what about Yeong Ju?

129
00:08:24,197 --> 00:08:26,239
I feel so bad. It's all because of us.

130
00:08:30,020 --> 00:08:32,520
- Aren't you eating with us?
- No, enjoy your meal.

131
00:08:35,450 --> 00:08:36,533
It's because of you, right?

132
00:08:37,916 --> 00:08:42,291
At least she's my mom, so I can tell her
I don't want to talk.

133
00:08:42,598 --> 00:08:45,265
That doesn't make it right.
I understand her.

134
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:47,280
I understand her too.

135
00:08:48,319 --> 00:08:50,742
But if he and I break up, that's on me.

136
00:08:50,924 --> 00:08:52,819
She shouldn't stop us
from seeing each other.

137
00:08:53,541 --> 00:08:54,954
Are you going to work?

138
00:08:57,367 --> 00:08:59,742
I need to settle things somehow.

139
00:09:00,567 --> 00:09:01,608
Try it.

140
00:09:05,393 --> 00:09:07,748
- How is it?
- It's bland.

141
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:09,901
- Hey, add some salt.
- Okay.

142
00:09:11,583 --> 00:09:13,298
I can't taste anything.

143
00:09:13,684 --> 00:09:17,671
Even candy doesn't taste sweet anymore.
I just eat it.

144
00:09:18,857 --> 00:09:21,941
Fine, just eat something.

145
00:09:23,311 --> 00:09:24,469
Thank you.

146
00:09:26,497 --> 00:09:28,164
Any news about your mom?

147
00:09:28,166 --> 00:09:31,291
Don't worry about her.
Focus on recovering first.

148
00:09:32,688 --> 00:09:35,980
But to be fair,
we can't blame Sa Bin's family.

149
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,834
We must seem strange to other people.

150
00:09:48,727 --> 00:09:49,935
You'll get indigestion.

151
00:09:55,236 --> 00:09:59,111
Thank you so much. I'm really sorry.

152
00:10:10,413 --> 00:10:11,631
Thank you.

153
00:10:23,954 --> 00:10:26,746
It's opening day,
and you have so many customers.

154
00:10:27,248 --> 00:10:29,543
You must've been worried
since it's your first time,

155
00:10:29,789 --> 00:10:32,248
but following the head office's guidelines
made the opening easier, right?

156
00:10:32,250 --> 00:10:35,708
Yes, I was really overwhelmed at first.

157
00:10:35,875 --> 00:10:40,458
Your help with the preparations made
everything so much easier. Thank you.

158
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,916
I'm glad.

159
00:10:42,083 --> 00:10:45,250
If you have any questions
while running the store, just call me.

160
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:47,166
Of course.

161
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:50,991
These are the new arrivals, right?

162
00:10:51,083 --> 00:10:52,125
That's right.

163
00:10:55,375 --> 00:10:57,282
This design is so pretty!

164
00:10:58,250 --> 00:11:00,458
I'll put these on right now.

165
00:11:04,958 --> 00:11:06,666
They're so pretty.

166
00:11:08,041 --> 00:11:09,541
They're so comfortable.

167
00:11:10,708 --> 00:11:11,832
They look great on you.

168
00:11:11,833 --> 00:11:12,916
- Really?
- Yes.

169
00:11:15,375 --> 00:11:16,567
What about the publishing house?

170
00:11:17,583 --> 00:11:19,147
I'll have to quit.

171
00:11:19,358 --> 00:11:22,375
I can't work with Ji Hu when he returns.

172
00:11:22,958 --> 00:11:26,486
I understand. It must be heartbreaking.

173
00:11:27,371 --> 00:11:30,371
Sometimes I feel like I'm not meant
to love anyone.

174
00:11:30,791 --> 00:11:33,916
Maybe this is my punishment,
just like Do Hee said.

175
00:11:33,958 --> 00:11:36,541
You take such silly thoughts seriously.

176
00:11:37,639 --> 00:11:40,764
But even if he lost his memory,

177
00:11:40,916 --> 00:11:44,125
I can't understand
why he'd choose Do Hee again.

178
00:11:44,708 --> 00:11:47,205
Can't we get the dashcam footage somehow?

179
00:11:47,359 --> 00:11:49,166
I want to show it to Ji Hu.

180
00:11:49,291 --> 00:11:51,541
The dashcam? From Do Hee's car?

181
00:11:51,583 --> 00:11:55,958
Yes, she swallowed it, then threw up
in front of the police.

182
00:11:56,083 --> 00:11:57,849
She made such a ridiculous scene.

183
00:11:58,250 --> 00:12:02,541
My mom saw the footage and wanted
to press charges for attempted murder,

184
00:12:02,666 --> 00:12:04,916
but they couldn't make the case.

185
00:12:05,083 --> 00:12:07,541
Ji Hu should've done it,
but now look at him.

186
00:12:09,375 --> 00:12:11,083
Do Hee is so lucky.

187
00:12:11,246 --> 00:12:14,829
Then we'll need to contact Ji Hu's lawyer
to get the footage.

188
00:12:16,083 --> 00:12:18,518
Anyway, go back to work for now.

189
00:12:19,333 --> 00:12:22,083
Ji Sung and In Ju will be shocked
when they return from vacation.

190
00:12:23,250 --> 00:12:25,693
I will. I should at least finish
things properly.

191
00:12:26,347 --> 00:12:27,389
What?

192
00:12:31,333 --> 00:12:32,375
Cosmetics?

193
00:12:32,416 --> 00:12:35,416
Isn't it amazing? It's a cosmetics brand.

194
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:39,583
It's a small company that made it big
in China with its sheet masks.

195
00:12:39,761 --> 00:12:45,345
Now they're making a comeback in Korea
and want you as their second model.

196
00:12:45,625 --> 00:12:47,541
So Ji will be the main model.

197
00:12:48,291 --> 00:12:50,583
So Ji is for the younger crowd,
and I'm for the older crowd?

198
00:12:50,625 --> 00:12:54,625
Exactly. This is a fantastic opportunity.

199
00:12:54,708 --> 00:12:58,165
I knew you were special,

200
00:12:58,167 --> 00:13:00,458
but I didn't expect things
to move this fast.

201
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:03,291
I told you I'd buy you a house.

202
00:13:03,534 --> 00:13:08,159
Once you appear in a magazine,
you should tell your daughter.

203
00:13:09,525 --> 00:13:11,358
My most terrifying daughter in the world.

204
00:13:14,515 --> 00:13:17,223
- Ms. Na Se Ri.
- Yes, I'm coming.

205
00:13:24,257 --> 00:13:25,590
I'll be back.

206
00:13:26,083 --> 00:13:27,875
Great. Next.

207
00:13:27,916 --> 00:13:30,426
One, two, three. Good.

208
00:13:30,427 --> 00:13:32,125
One more. One, two, three.

209
00:13:33,031 --> 00:13:34,781
Look ahead, then move back a little.

210
00:13:34,792 --> 00:13:36,458
Lower your chin. Great.

211
00:13:37,750 --> 00:13:40,708
Look straight ahead. One, two, three.

212
00:14:13,208 --> 00:14:14,583
My head hurts.

213
00:14:34,778 --> 00:14:36,986
Hey. Ji Hu, it's me.

214
00:14:37,121 --> 00:14:38,204
Hey, you're here?

215
00:14:40,245 --> 00:14:41,287
What's this?

216
00:14:48,041 --> 00:14:49,560
This is Ji Ni and me.

217
00:14:49,765 --> 00:14:50,848
What are you talking about?

218
00:14:52,666 --> 00:14:54,625
It's me. I drew it.

219
00:14:55,916 --> 00:14:56,958
You did?

220
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,625
Don't lie. That's Ji Ni.

221
00:15:01,502 --> 00:15:05,248
It's me, Aunt. You don't even know.

222
00:15:05,250 --> 00:15:06,465
Why wouldn't I know?

223
00:15:07,625 --> 00:15:13,208
He said you locked Ji Ni in a storage room
and then they escaped together.

224
00:15:13,691 --> 00:15:15,793
You came to me that day
and told me yourself.

225
00:15:15,961 --> 00:15:18,711
You said you were so happy,
like you'd been set free.

226
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:20,625
- I did?
- Yes.

227
00:15:20,666 --> 00:15:24,338
Living with a mistress
must've muddled your mind too.

228
00:15:24,416 --> 00:15:26,541
Stop talking nonsense and leave.

229
00:15:26,875 --> 00:15:28,416
How dare you speak to an elder like that?

230
00:15:29,250 --> 00:15:30,291
Ji Hu.

231
00:15:31,791 --> 00:15:35,313
Ji Hu, I wouldn't lie.

232
00:15:35,848 --> 00:15:37,173
Think about it carefully.

233
00:15:47,416 --> 00:15:48,691
Did you really draw this?

234
00:15:50,905 --> 00:15:54,864
It did turn out a little strange.
I'll draw another one.

235
00:15:55,916 --> 00:15:57,106
No, it's fine.

236
00:16:00,583 --> 00:16:02,999
No one loves you as much as I do.

237
00:16:03,705 --> 00:16:04,791
Please believe me.

238
00:16:06,250 --> 00:16:09,208
Come on. We planned to look at dresses.

239
00:16:11,250 --> 00:16:12,625
Ji Hu's mother is asking for you.

240
00:16:13,577 --> 00:16:15,161
Ji Hu, wait a moment.

241
00:16:39,380 --> 00:16:41,880
Do Hee locked Ji Ni up?

242
00:16:43,083 --> 00:16:44,418
Take a good look.

243
00:16:44,724 --> 00:16:48,166
You loved this painting.
It meant so much to you.

244
00:16:51,540 --> 00:16:54,873
Is this us running
after getting out of the storage room?

245
00:16:54,932 --> 00:16:56,140
That's what I heard.

246
00:16:56,166 --> 00:16:58,208
Who told you? Could that be a lie?

247
00:16:58,291 --> 00:17:01,432
You told me yourself.

248
00:17:01,922 --> 00:17:04,880
She locked Ji Ni in,
but you were already inside.

249
00:17:05,232 --> 00:17:08,816
You said you looked after Ji Ni
when she had a panic attack.

250
00:17:09,589 --> 00:17:14,173
You loved her, but couldn't tell her
because she rejected the idea of love.

251
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:18,001
You shared that with me alone, right here.

252
00:17:20,463 --> 00:17:23,005
I guess I really liked you, Aunt.

253
00:17:23,472 --> 00:17:26,347
I really liked you too, Ji Hu.

254
00:17:27,541 --> 00:17:30,958
I hope all your memories come back soon.

255
00:17:31,825 --> 00:17:33,301
Don't give up until then.

256
00:17:33,807 --> 00:17:35,363
Don't go to England.

257
00:17:42,708 --> 00:17:45,766
Hello. Is Ji Hu here?

258
00:17:45,918 --> 00:17:47,126
He's on the second floor.

259
00:17:53,166 --> 00:17:55,424
Hey, Tae O. It's been so long.

260
00:17:57,041 --> 00:17:59,814
Not that long.
It's only been two or three weeks.

261
00:17:59,930 --> 00:18:01,385
How did this happen in that time?

262
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:02,833
It's driving me crazy.

263
00:18:07,875 --> 00:18:09,154
Hey, Tae O.

264
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:12,488
Do Hee. It's been a while.

265
00:18:12,787 --> 00:18:15,703
This is my future husband's home,
so I get to play host.

266
00:18:17,125 --> 00:18:22,333
- Do Hee, give us a minute. Sorry.
- Why?

267
00:18:24,708 --> 00:18:26,457
- Hey.
- What do you think you're doing?

268
00:18:26,458 --> 00:18:29,125
- Pull yourself together and listen.
- Open the door! Open it!

269
00:18:29,534 --> 00:18:33,617
Ji Hu! Hey, Geum Tae O!

270
00:18:36,310 --> 00:18:39,435
Enough. You're in someone else's home.
How can you behave like this?

271
00:18:40,208 --> 00:18:41,621
It's not someone else's house.

272
00:18:42,458 --> 00:18:46,708
Whatever nonsense you tell Ji Hu,
we're getting married soon, Aunt.

273
00:18:47,208 --> 00:18:48,891
Then I'll be the official wife.

274
00:18:49,692 --> 00:18:51,000
Just like you.

275
00:18:51,615 --> 00:18:53,931
I hear you made Na Se Ri's life miserable.

276
00:18:54,714 --> 00:18:56,164
I really like that about you.

277
00:18:56,166 --> 00:18:58,785
I'll make sure this wedding never happens.

278
00:18:58,892 --> 00:19:00,750
Sa Bin and I will do everything we can.

279
00:19:00,791 --> 00:19:04,000
I'm lucky. Look at how things are now.

280
00:19:04,875 --> 00:19:08,291
You are. But your luck won't last forever.

281
00:19:11,916 --> 00:19:13,000
Hey.

282
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:18,208
What's wrong with you?
Do you want me to scold you?

283
00:19:18,916 --> 00:19:21,645
Aunt, why are you treating me like this?

284
00:19:21,646 --> 00:19:23,583
I told you I'd do my best.

285
00:19:23,958 --> 00:19:28,916
Why do you like Ji Ni?
Don't you hate a mistress's daughter?

286
00:19:29,958 --> 00:19:33,208
Director Cha is the same.
I really don't understand any of you.

287
00:19:34,958 --> 00:19:37,166
I did hate Ji Ni.

288
00:19:37,250 --> 00:19:39,291
Exactly. She's your enemy.

289
00:19:39,333 --> 00:19:44,708
She won both Seung Woo and me over.
We couldn't help accepting her as family.

290
00:19:44,958 --> 00:19:47,125
There was such warmth in how she loved us.

291
00:19:47,833 --> 00:19:50,708
What's missing from your life
that you keep lying like this?

292
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,375
How can you go on living this way?

293
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:57,416
If you truly care about Ji Hu,
respect his past words and actions.

294
00:19:57,458 --> 00:19:59,666
You're treating him like a fool.

295
00:20:00,463 --> 00:20:04,797
Won't he be even more furious
if he remembers everything?

296
00:20:05,833 --> 00:20:07,291
Not if he never remembers.

297
00:20:11,094 --> 00:20:15,010
Please stop doing this and help me.

298
00:20:15,291 --> 00:20:19,041
You could've told him earlier
that it was me in the painting.

299
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,297
I'll do better.

300
00:20:32,541 --> 00:20:36,125
So this is why you wanted
to contact my lawyer.

301
00:20:37,083 --> 00:20:38,625
This case concerns you.

302
00:20:40,541 --> 00:20:41,801
Do you understand now?

303
00:20:41,908 --> 00:20:44,535
You got hurt saving Ji Ni. And Do Hee...

304
00:20:44,958 --> 00:20:48,458
did this because she couldn't stand
that you were in love with Ji Ni.

305
00:20:51,553 --> 00:20:52,720
That's me?

306
00:20:55,623 --> 00:20:58,706
Wouldn't I have done the same
for someone other than Ji Ni?

307
00:20:58,708 --> 00:21:00,458
With a car trying to run you over?

308
00:21:01,500 --> 00:21:03,541
I honestly don't know.

309
00:21:05,338 --> 00:21:11,755
Actually, before going to America,
I confessed my feelings to Ji Ni.

310
00:21:13,541 --> 00:21:18,386
I still have feelings for her.
But she rejected me.

311
00:21:20,791 --> 00:21:24,515
You're the one she really loves, Ji Hu.

312
00:21:24,935 --> 00:21:26,332
That's why I backed off.

313
00:21:41,250 --> 00:21:44,775
Register your marriage right away.
Then come to England.

314
00:21:49,166 --> 00:21:50,208
Ji Hu.

315
00:21:53,769 --> 00:21:55,000
Go home.

316
00:21:55,716 --> 00:21:58,144
I'll talk with Tae O a little longer
and call you later.

317
00:21:58,208 --> 00:22:00,253
About what? Let me join you.

318
00:22:01,833 --> 00:22:04,408
Where to? I'm coming with you.

319
00:22:06,288 --> 00:22:08,021
No need to get involved, Do Hee.

320
00:22:08,166 --> 00:22:10,958
Ji Hu, let's go. See you later.

321
00:22:18,685 --> 00:22:19,854
Geum Tae O.

322
00:22:49,250 --> 00:22:51,000
(Resident Registration Card, Im Ji Hu)

323
00:23:15,166 --> 00:23:18,569
Sir, are you feeling better?

324
00:23:18,570 --> 00:23:20,625
I heard you were hurt in an accident.

325
00:23:21,166 --> 00:23:22,608
A little.

326
00:23:23,291 --> 00:23:24,291
Where's Ji Ni?

327
00:23:24,333 --> 00:23:26,375
She went to do something
in the book storage room.

328
00:23:26,710 --> 00:23:28,835
Has something happened to Ji Ni?

329
00:23:28,916 --> 00:23:31,708
She looked gaunt and worried.

330
00:23:32,166 --> 00:23:35,416
No, I think she had some trouble
with her mom.

331
00:23:36,416 --> 00:23:37,585
Want to take a look around?

332
00:23:37,958 --> 00:23:39,000
Okay.

333
00:23:42,338 --> 00:23:45,047
Why would he need to look around?
He owns the place.

334
00:23:47,333 --> 00:23:50,247
It's just been a while since he was here.

335
00:25:55,875 --> 00:25:59,066
Why save me? Don't save me.

336
00:26:01,416 --> 00:26:04,958
I don't want to live. Don't save me.

337
00:26:07,458 --> 00:26:09,833
- Excuse me...
- Don't touch me!

338
00:26:11,250 --> 00:26:12,791
I said, don't touch me!

339
00:26:13,708 --> 00:26:16,586
I was abandoned when I was born.

340
00:26:17,112 --> 00:26:18,666
My adoptive parents brought me up.

341
00:26:20,166 --> 00:26:22,041
I live my life trying
to repay their kindness.

342
00:27:26,291 --> 00:27:27,493
Ji Hu.

343
00:27:30,333 --> 00:27:31,487
Ji Ni.

344
00:28:43,708 --> 00:28:46,958
(Family Register)

345
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:49,791
Are your memories really back?
You remember everything?

346
00:28:49,833 --> 00:28:51,416
You're Ji Ni, the woman I love.

347
00:28:51,458 --> 00:28:53,625
We're married now.
You're happy too, right?

348
00:28:53,666 --> 00:28:56,041
Find someone normal to love
and have a normal relationship.

349
00:28:56,083 --> 00:28:58,000
Then you should've had me
under normal circumstances.

350
00:28:58,041 --> 00:28:59,333
Today's our first day, right?

351
00:28:59,375 --> 00:29:02,416
I'm so glad I got another chance.

352
00:29:02,458 --> 00:29:04,041
Congratulations, Ji Hu.

353
00:29:04,166 --> 00:29:05,297
Do you really mean it?

354
00:29:06,981 --> 00:29:08,981
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
